                <pb facs="1006" n="892" xml:id="pg892"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">816.51/222: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Salvador</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Hewes</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1923-01-09T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 9,
                                1923—5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>2. Department’s December 30, 5 p.m. Department has now informed bankers that it
                    has no objection to their proceeding under loan contract of June 24 last.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
